Lay a trap that explodes into a radius 2 cloud of freezing vapour when triggered.  Foes take [104, 123, 137, 149, 160 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] cold damage and are pinned for 3 turns.

The freezing vapour persists for 5 turns, dealing [35, 41, 46, 50, 53 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] cold damage each turn to foes with a 25% chance to freeze.

This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.
